    I've been told that the sound of the 'beep' on the AlphaStation 200 and
    250 can be improved by moving the internal speaker connection from the
    small sound card (at a four-pin header marked J5) to the Main Logic
    Board (at a similar four-pin header marked J15).

    If this is done, you now require external speakers if you want to use
    the sound card's output.

