We have outgrown our pair of DEC 3000/700 machines running OSF and plan to
purchase a multiprocessor server and are considering an 8200 machine with 4
processors which will be running OSF.  Any experiences with this or comparable
configurations would be appreciated.  I guess what we want to know is if there
are any "problems" with multiprocessor machines and OSF :-)

Many thanks.

