My query was about improving response on our news system.

Since there were literally pages and pages of responses, I am only
posting a short summary.  Please email me if anyone would like the full
responses.

The short summary is:
1. Know your system better.
2. Use multiple disks instead of a single huge one.  Use LSM on OSF UFS
   to stripe them.
3. Split the news spool area vs rest of the system across separate spindles.
4. If an option, go to a smaller block/fragment size when building the
   file system.
