>second argument of the listen() system call (done in your SMTP
>listener) to be equally large, or larger. 


This seems to be the correct advice.  In case anyone else sees this
problem
	dbx -k /vmunix
	assign somaxconn=large #
	exit

sets the kernel variable, and

	OOListen=large #

in the sendmail config file tells sendmail 8 what number to use
for the "backlog" variable in the "listen" system call.

Thanks much for the help.

--
Jeff Hayward



