Christopher M. Conway (wombat@barq.aquilagroup.com) wrote:

: I've started seeing this error on my DECSystem 4000/600 (Cobra),
: running OSF/1 V3.2A rev 17:

: Sep  7 18:40:13 woogf vmunix: fork/procdup: task_create failed. Code: 0x11

: I have no idea what it means or whether I should care. The obvious
: interpretation is that I've run out of process table space-- but I've
: set up for something like 1000 users, MAXPROC 10000, and typically there
: are about 200ish processes running.

